  finding = "the A⊥G OPPONENT substrate does NOT reproduce the planning faithful↑/big-Φ↓ split. On the opponent contrast (OPPONENT − matched ADDITIVE control, SAME engine weights, ONLY the opponent SIGN removed) faithful moves DOWN (−0.1559) and big-Φ moves UP (+0.9413) = the EXACT OPPOSITE polarity to the planning split (faith-UP/big-DOWN). Per-mode means: OPPONENT faith 0.6468±0.7644 / big 10.3186±2.7230 ; ADDITIVE faith 0.8027±0.7406 / big 9.3773±2.3921 ; SINGLE faith 1.2758±1.2267 / big 9.6141±2.5692. Removing the opponent structure does NOT install the split, and the opponent structure itself produces (if anything) the REVERSE contrast ⇒ the sign-split is PLANNING-SPECIFIC, carried by coupled forward-rolled multi-branch deliberation (the large AND surgically-removable redundancy block of H_1039/H_1062), NOT by the engine's bounded opponent self-dynamics — consistent with H_1062. CONSTRUCTION-DEFECT FIX before scoring (H_1061 discipline, bar NOT moved): a plain accumulator x+=LR(A−G) DIVERGED (norm~42) → monotone-ramp binarization → DEGENERATE Φ bit-identical across all modes (faith=3.0000±0 / big=11.6475±0, saturation tautology = H_1051/H_1061 trap); fixed with a LEAKY/contractive update x=(1−LR)x+LR·upd (LR=0.70), the engine's BOUNDED Ψ=1/2 fixed-point regime, plus a NON-DEGENERACY guard (per-mode Φ across-seed variance True; opponent≠additive macro-bits on 12/12 seeds) that VOIDs a degenerate run."
  method = "BOTH stdlib IIT-4.0 CPU mirrors (h1004_bigphi_faithful_clean) RE-PROVEN ≡ stdlib at n=4 AND n=5 BEFORE scoring (h1012.prove_mirrors_at_n; a_phi_iit4_tool NO proxy, MI=BITS/log2) — LIVE refs this Mac: hexa run h1012_ref_faithful.hexa → faithful_n4=3000000001/n5=4000000001/n6=5000000002 (×1e9); hexa run h1012_ref_check.hexa → ring5/6 bigphi=2999999999 (×1e9); in-run |Δ| big-Φ 1.34e-10, faithful 3.48e-10(n4)/7.97e-10(n5). engine_A,engine_G = two FIXED distinct tanh-FFN maps (Engine A ⊥ Engine G, seeds 4040+s / 9090+s); OPPONENT upd=A(x)−G(x) vs matched NON-opponent ADDITIVE upd=A(x)+G(x) (same weights, opponent sign removed) + SINGLE (A only); leaky-bounded integrate; read = top-variance channels median-binarized (EXACT H_1039/H_1064). FROZEN SIGN_EPS=1e-3, N_SEEDS=12 (≥10), n=4 EXACT (n=5 mirror). reproduce-H_1039 anchor confirmed in THIS mirror (planning faith+2.1615 UP / big−4.2403 DOWN, SPLIT True, ref +2.33/−4.01). IMPORTS by REAL module name (H_1038); SERIAL, NO Pool (H_1038 hang); $0 CPU-local no GPU/pod; g5 (p7)."
